{
 "duration": 25.572,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the way down, Maya's boot skids on a shaded rock.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.499
  },
  {
   "text": "Frost.",
   "start": 3.649,
   "end": 4.249
  },
  {
   "text": "In November, shady parts of a trail can stay icy long after the sun is up.",
   "start": 4.499,
   "end": 8.786
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Watch for shine on rock, roots and boardwalk.",
   "start": 9.136,
   "end": 12.881
  },
  {
   "text": "Step on gravel, leaves or the rough edge instead.",
   "start": 13.081,
   "end": 16.074
  },
  {
   "text": "Take short steps with your weight over your feet,",
   "start": 16.274,
   "end": 18.612
  },
  {
   "text": "and plant your pole first for balance.",
   "start": 18.712,
   "end": 20.583
  },
  {
   "text": "If the whole trail is glazed, turn back.",
   "start": 20.833,
   "end": 22.99
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 23.34,
   "end": 25.372
  }
 ],
